.TH JACKTHESOLO 1 "October 2026" "jackthesolo 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
jackthesolo \- download almost anything: media, direct files, cloud drive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B jackthesolo
.RI [ OPTIONS ] " URL"
.br
.B jackthesolo --check
.br
.B jackthesolo --help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B jackthesolo
is a multi-source downloader with URL auto-detect:
cloud-drive preview/share links \(-> cloud mode (Network-tab imitation),
.IR .pdf /.zip /...
\(-> direct-file mode, everything else \(-> yt-dlp (tested on YouTube and
TikTok; other sites best-effort, not individually tested).
.PP
Privacy on by default: randomized User-Agent each run,
Tor as mandatory route (fail-closed), isolated circuit per download,
sensitive tokens redacted from logs.
.SH MODES
Auto-detect runs when no mode flag is given:
.TP
.B cloud
Cloud-drive preview/share links (e.g. SharePoint/OneDrive).
Opens the preview page in a headless browser (Playwright)
and taps the file stream from the Network tab. Requires
.BR --cookies .
.TP
.B direct
URL path ending in a file extension (.pdf .zip .rar .mp4 ...).
Straight HTTP download, cookies optional.
.TP
.B scribd
scribd.com documents to PDF via embed, no login.
.TP
.B media
.br
All other URLs via yt-dlp: pick resolution, audio-only MP3, playlist,
and inspect metadata via
.B --info
and
.BR --list-formats .
TikTok /video|photo/<id> URLs plus
.B --cookies
use the TikTok engine (TLS impersonation, video + photos incl. subs-only),
falling back to yt-dlp on failure.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -o ", " --output " \fIDIR\fR"
Output folder (default:
.IR ~/Downloads ).
.TP
.BR -a ", " --audio-only
Audio only (MP3, media mode).
.TP
.BR -q ", " --quality " \fIQ\fR"
Media mode quality: best, 1080, 720, 480, 360 (default: best).
.TP
.B --allow-playlist
Allow full playlist (default: single video).
.TP
.BR -y ", " --yes
Skip batch download confirmation.
.TP
.BR --max " \fIN\fR"
Max batch items for profile/playlist. TikTok profile URLs
automatically become batch mode.
.TP
.B --dry-run
List batch items first without downloading.
.TP
.BR --retries " \fIN\fR"
Total attempts per download on transient errors (default: 3).
Retries use backoff and resume partial files.
.TP
.BR --cookies " \fIFILE\fR"
Path to YOUR Netscape cookies.txt (required for login content).
No default location; each user exports their own.
.TP
.BR --proxy " \fIURL\fR"
http/https/socks5 proxy, e.g. socks5h://127.0.0.1:9050.
.TP
.B --tor
Force traffic through Tor (needs Tor on 127.0.0.1:9050).
.TP
.B --no-proxy
Force direct connection (for login content).
.TP
.B --no-random-ua
Disable random UA.
.TP
.BR --user-agent " \fIS\fR"
Manual User-Agent.
.TP
.B --cloud
Force cloud-drive preview mode.
.TP
.B --scribd
Force scribd document mode.
.TP
.BR --wait " \fIN\fR"
Seconds to wait for preview to load (default: 25).
.TP
.B --direct
Force direct-file mode.
.TP
.BR --output-file " \fINAME\fR"
Output file name.
.TP
.B --info
Show title/uploader/duration (media mode).
.TP
.B --list-formats
Show available formats (media mode).
.TP
.BR -v ", " --verbose
Verbose (error details stay redacted).
.TP
.B --paranoid
Fail-closed: require anonymous egress proof + refuse cookies/login.
.TP
.BR --url-file " \fIFILE\fR"
Read URL from a file so tokens stay out of shell history.
.TP
.B --no-banner
Hide ASCII banner.
.TP
.B --check
Check ffmpeg, yt-dlp, proxy, playwright.
.SH COOKIES
The program ships no cookies. For login content:
.RS
.nf
# 1. Open the site in Chrome (logged into your account)
# 2. Export via the "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY" extension
# 3. Use:
jackthesolo "URL" --cookies cookies.txt
chmod 600 cookies.txt
.fi
.RE
.SH PRIVACY
Random UA ON; Tor (127.0.0.1:9050) default mandatory route for public
downloads; fresh isolated circuit per download; DNS over Tor.
Downloading with your account cookies tells the server who you are.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
jackthesolo "URL"
jackthesolo "https://.../shared?..." \\
    --cookies cookies.txt --output-file Document.pdf
jackthesolo "https://www.tiktok.com/@u/video/123" --audio-only
jackthesolo "https://example.com/data.zip"
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Downloads
Default output folder.
.TP
.I cookies.example.txt
Cookie format example (not real cookies).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Download failed.
.TP
.B 2
Missing arguments/cookies (see message).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yt-dlp (1),
.BR tor (1)
